# KiBlast state (start of the held ki volley, owner 2026-10-11): XV2 ATC_SHOT_R (right hand). The blast leaves the RIGHT hand bone at f12 (XV2 BAC 0 fires at f14).
# Holding the blast input past f22 chains into KiBlastL / KiBlastR (SHOT_L_LOOP / SHOT_R_LOOP, alternating hands, 5 ki each; goku.lua kiblast_frame); release = this clip's tail, free at f26.
# HB-DESIGN: the KiBlast article (combo.json articles[0], bone = hand.R part) is the owner-accepted designed projectile; this state has no hitbox of its own.
